menu "reBuddy arm components"
    config REBUDDY_ARM_DAILY_CONTROL
        bool "Enable screen-driven daily arm control"
        default n
        help
            Active CAN1 with native RS motor service and gravity compensation.
            Boot shows SLEEP without enabling. Click the wake arrow to execute WAKE.
            Requires the exported calibration and independent support.
    config REBUDDY_ARM_DANCE_CONTROL
        bool "Enable touch and serial Dance choreography"
        default n
        depends on REBUDDY_ARM_DAILY_CONTROL
        help
            Ten offline-checked trajectories, seeded random selection and C2 joins.
            Touch playback and serial commands share the Daily motor task.
            Boot never starts motion.
            No Dance GIF synchronization. Requires current calibration/support.
    config REBUDDY_ARM_MONITOR
        bool "Start CAN1 in passive listen-only mode"
        default n
        depends on !REBUDDY_ARM_DAILY_CONTROL
        help
            Receives existing RS status broadcasts at 1 Mbps. Sends no frames
            or ACKs and does not discover, configure or enable motors.
            Another active CAN node is needed to acknowledge broadcasts.
            Disabled by default: both transceivers remain in standby.
endmenu
